#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: montecchiani-book-catalog.php
msgid "Montecchiani Book Catalog"
msgstr "Montecchiani Book Catalog"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: montecchiani-book-catalog.php
msgid "https://github.com/mirkomontecchiani/WP-BookCatalog"
msgstr "https://github.com/mirkomontecchiani/WP-BookCatalog"

#. Description of the plugin
#: montecchiani-book-catalog.php
msgid "Book catalog with a Book post type, genres, a responsive shortcode grid and one-click ISBN autofill from Google Books and Open Library."
msgstr "Каталог книг с типом записи «Книга», жанрами, адаптивной сеткой, выводимой шорткодом, и автозаполнением по ISBN в один клик из Google Books и Open Library."

#. Author of the plugin
#: montecchiani-book-catalog.php
msgid "Mirko Montecchiani"
msgstr "Mirko Montecchiani"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: montecchiani-book-catalog.php
msgid "https://github.com/mirkomontecchiani"
msgstr "https://github.com/mirkomontecchiani"

